flowchart LR
  %% Figure 2.17: Conversation persistence and retrieval
  id["Session ID"]
  session["SessionRepository get/create"]
  process["Process turn: speech/text, HSR, dialogue, LLM"]
  ok["Generation succeeds"]
  turn["Insert conversation_turn"]
  fail["Failure: no successful turn insert"]
  history["List/detail history API"]
  trajectory["State trajectory API"]
  local["Browser localStorage prototype (separate)"]
  id -->|session lookup| session
  session -->|turn request| process
  process -->|provider returns text| ok
  ok -->|persist| turn
  process -->|processing/provider error| fail
  turn -->|retrieve turns| history
  session -->|list sessions| history
  turn -->|stored HSR history| trajectory
  local -->|not source of DB history| history
